  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "kin_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Kinetic type\n\nText Animate moves text glyph by glyph, no ForEach needed. The top line comes in (`in` mode): each letter rises, turns and fades in after the one before as `progress` runs 0 → 1, and leaves the same way. The bottom line rides a sine (`wave` mode) that rolls through it as `progress` loops.\n\nTry the `order` (center, random) and `ease` dropdowns.",
        "width": 470,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Kinetic type\n\nText Animate moves text glyph by glyph, no ForEach needed. The top line comes in (`in` mode): each letter rises, turns and fades in after the one before as `progress` runs 0 → 1, and leaves the same way. The bottom line rides a sine (`wave` mode) that rolls through it as `progress` loops.\n\nTry the `order` (center, random) and `ease` dropdowns.",
        "width": 470,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
